hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"354","[AI-translation] Ham se hadees bayan ki Haroon bin Musa bin Abi Alqamah Madini ne, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe hadees bayan ki mere walid ne, Hisham bin Sa'd se, Zaid bin Aslam se, un ke walid se, Hazrat Umar bin Khattab se, ke ek shakhs Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur un se maanga ke (woh) use ata karein. Toh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere paas kuch nahi hai, magar tum mere naam se khareed lo, phir jab mere paas kuch aa jaye toh main adaa kar dunga. Toh Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Main ne use de diya, pas Allah aap ko aise kaam ka mukallif nahi karta jo aap ke bas mein na ho. Toh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Umar ka yeh kehna na-pasand aaya. Phir Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Kharch karein aur Aarsh wale ke qaal (kam hone) se na darrein. Toh Rasool-e-Allah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muskuraye aur un ke chehre par Ansari ke kehne ki wajah se khushi numaya hui. Phir farmaya: Mujhe isi ka hukm diya gaya hai."
"355","[AI-translation] Hamein Ali bin Hujr ne hadith suna'i, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sharik ne khabar di, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqil se, Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwidh bin 'Afra se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas taaza khajoor aur narm kheeron ki tokri lekar aayi, to unhon ne mujhe apne haath bhar zewar aur sona diya."
